abstract: "A versioned research account of purpose-relative complete means, construction witnesses, capability inheritance and tests of construction learning. Edition 1.1.0 preserves the first edition and adds a registered public-image microscopy continuation, a reproduction of the exposed six-arm constructor comparison, and a separately identified pretrained specialist. The pretrained nucleus route meets its source research contract; the whole-cell successor fails and the local constructor comparison ties. It distinguishes useful operation, successor qualification, constructor advantage and funded continuation."
